    "typographyMeta": {
      "headline": {
        "displayName": "Stat value",
        "purpose": "Bold 28sp tabular numbers in stat trios; always over a Label."
      },
      "title": {
        "displayName": "Strip / title",
        "purpose": "Status strip copy, dialog and card titles."
      },
      "label": {
        "displayName": "Label",
        "purpose": "Uppercase tracked word above every value; section headers."
      }
    },
    "shadows": [
      {
        "name": "card",
        "value": "4dp elevation (Tokens.cardElevation)",
        "purpose": "The floating stat card."
      },
      {
        "name": "floating",
        "value": "6dp elevation (Tokens.floatingElevation)",
        "purpose": "Map pills, the thumbstick base, the search field."
      },
      {
        "name": "sheet",
        "value": "8dp elevation (Tokens.sheetElevation)",
        "purpose": "The bottom sheet."
      },
      {
        "name": "popover",
        "value": "8dp elevation (Tokens.popoverElevation)",
        "purpose": "Popovers, the search dropdown and dialogs."
      },
      {
        "name": "marker",
        "value": "baked 3dp blur, 1.5dp down, #00000048 (MapPalette.markerShadow)",
        "purpose": "Stop discs and the search pin on the map."
      },
      {
        "name": "dark-rim",
        "value": "1dp floating-outline-dark instead of a visible shadow",
        "purpose": "In dark, anything over the map (and the sheet's top edge) is rimmed: a near-black shadow vanished on the dark map."
      }
    ],
    "motion": [
      {
        "name": "strip-tone",
        "value": "colour 200ms tween; words fade through (out 90ms, in 200ms after)",
        "purpose": "The band changes state as one surface: new words never sit on the old colour."
      },
      {
        "name": "fade-through",
        "value": "out 90ms, in 300ms (delay 90ms) + scale 0.96→1",
        "purpose": "The sheet peek swapping in place (Start → Pause → End drive · Resume)."
      },
      {
        "name": "floating-enter-exit",
        "value": "scale 0.8→1 + fade, 300ms in / 200ms out",
        "purpose": "Card, thumbstick and builder tools popping from their centre."
      },
      {
        "name": "top-chrome",
        "value": "slide + fade, 300ms in / 200ms out",
        "purpose": "Search bar and FABs leaving upward during playback."
      },
      {
        "name": "camera-follow",
        "value": "easeCamera 900ms; jumps after a >5s gap (back in the app)",
        "purpose": "Follow mode per fix; honours the system animator scale."
      },
      {
        "name": "puck-glide",
        "value": "linear, the fix interval clamped 150–1500ms",
        "purpose": "The dot and its wobble range glide between fixes."
      }
    ],
    "breakpoints": [
      {
        "name": "compact",
        "value": "width < 600dp",
        "purpose": "Phone portrait: search on top, card over the sheet."
      },
      {
        "name": "short-wide",
        "value": "height < 480dp and width >= 600dp",
        "purpose": "Landscape phones: the overlay becomes a start-side panel (min(420dp, half the width))."
      },
      {
        "name": "wide",
        "value": "width >= 600dp",
        "purpose": "Tablets: sheet, card, search and tools centred and capped at 640dp. No navigation bar or rail on any width."
      }
    ]
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Filled Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one verb that moves you forward on a surface: Pause, Resume, Start of route, Done, Save.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Start of route</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; height:56px; padding:0 16px; border:none; border-radius:9999px; background:#3949AB; color:#FFFFFF; font:700 16px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; cursor:pointer; transition:filter .2s; } .ds-pill:hover { filter:brightness(1.08); } .ds-pill:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #DEE0FF; outline-offset:2px; } .ds-pill:active { filter:brightness(.92); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outlined Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outlined",
      "description": "The alternative or the way out, always left of the filled pill: Cancel, End drive, My location.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill-outline\">End drive</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill-outline { height:56px; padding:0 16px; border:1px solid #767680; border-radius:9999px; background:transparent; color:#3949AB; font:700 16px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; cursor:pointer; transition:background .2s; } .ds-pill-outline:hover { background:#DEE0FF55; } .ds-pill-outline:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #DEE0FF; outline-offset:2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Small Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-small",
      "description": "The compact button for rows, lists, the band and snackbars; takes a tinted surface's own ink. No text-only buttons.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-small-pill\">Clear history</button>",
      "css": ".ds-small-pill { height:40px; padding:0 16px; border:1px solid #767680; border-radius:9999px; background:transparent; color:#3949AB; font:700 14px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; cursor:pointer; transition:background .2s; } .ds-small-pill:hover { background:#DEE0FF55; } .ds-small-pill:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #DEE0FF; outline-offset:2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "strip-hold",
      "description": "The session's one line of state, tinted by tone; its action is a Small Pill in the band's own ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-band\"><span>Holding at North Olive Street</span><button class=\"ds-band-pill\">Stop holding</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-band { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; min-height:48px; padding:0 20px; background:#FFDEA8; color:#2B1A00; font:700 16px/1.3 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; border-radius:16px 16px 0 0; } .ds-band span { flex:1; } .ds-band-pill { height:40px; padding:0 16px; border:1px solid currentColor; border-radius:9999px; background:transparent; color:inherit; font:700 14px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; cursor:pointer; } .ds-band-pill:focus-visible { outline:2px solid currentColor; outline-offset:2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stat Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "stat-card",
      "description": "Strava's run box: the status band over a value-over-label trio, floating above the sheet in every state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stat-card\"><div class=\"ds-stat-band\">Ready to drive</div><div class=\"ds-trio\"><div><b>2.7 mi</b><span>Distance</span></div><div><b>12 min</b><span>Duration</span></div><div><b>3</b><span>Stops</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stat-card { width:360px; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.18); font-family:Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; } .ds-stat-band { min-height:48px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:#A6F2CD; color:#002114; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; } .ds-trio { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); padding:12px 20px; text-align:center; } .ds-trio b { display:block; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:#1A1B21; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; } .ds-trio span { font-size:12px; color:#45464F; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Speed Presets",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "speed-presets",
      "description": "Five speeds in one row of segmented buttons under a SPEED caption; the selected one filled, no check mark.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button>0.25×</button><button>0.5×</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\">1×</button><button>2×</button><button>4×</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg { display:inline-flex; border:1px solid #767680; border-radius:9999px; overflow:hidden; font:500 14px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; } .ds-seg button { height:40px; min-width:60px; padding:0 4px; border:none; border-right:1px solid #767680; background:transparent; color:#1A1B21; cursor:pointer; } .ds-seg button:last-child { border-right:none; } .ds-seg button[aria-pressed=true] { background:#DEE0FF; color:#0A1B6B; } .ds-seg button:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #3949AB; outline-offset:-2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Map Pill",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "map-pill",
      "description": "A 48dp white circle with a soft shadow and an on-surface glyph; filled indigo when selected (Follow).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-map-pill\" aria-label=\"Go to my location\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 1v4M12 19v4M1 12h4M19 12h4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-map-pill { width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; border:none; display:grid; place-items:center; background:#FFFFFF; color:#1A1B21; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2); cursor:pointer; } .ds-map-pill:hover { background:#F4F3FA; } .ds-map-pill:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #3949AB; outline-offset:2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Floating place search: white fill, 12dp corner, no border until focused; its dropdown floats over the controls below.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><input placeholder=\"Search for a place\" aria-label=\"Search for a place\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M15 15l6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; width:360px; height:56px; padding:0 16px; border-radius:12px; background:#FFFFFF; color:#45464F; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.18); border:2px solid transparent; } .ds-search input { flex:1; border:none; outline:none; background:transparent; font:400 16px/1.5 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; color:#1A1B21; } .ds-search:focus-within { border-color:#3949AB; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stop Disc",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stop-disc",
      "description": "Numbered stop in the list, mirroring the map markers: green start, indigo via, near-black destination.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-disc ds-disc-start\">1</span><span class=\"ds-disc ds-disc-via\">2</span><span class=\"ds-disc ds-disc-end\">3</span>",
      "css": ".ds-disc { display:inline-grid; place-items:center; width:28px; height:28px; margin-right:8px; border-radius:50%; font:700 12px/1 Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif; color:#fff; } .ds-disc-start { background:#1A7D52; } .ds-disc-via { background:#3949AB; } .ds-disc-end { background:#1A1B21; }"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Quiet Dashboard",
    "overview": "Mockarr looks like a car's instrument cluster at night: neutral surfaces, one indigo\nsignal, big bold numerals, and state shown as a tinted band on a card that floats over\nthe map. The map is the product; every piece of chrome either serves the drive in progress\nor recedes. Colour appears where it means something — the route, the position, the primary\naction, the state strip — and nowhere else; weight and lift (bold type, soft shadows, a\n80dp Start) carry the energy instead.\n\nThe system is Material 3 in structure (sheet, chips, snackbars, pills) with a hand-authored\nindigo scheme on every API level; dynamic colour is off so the map palette never fights a\nwallpaper. Dark is designed as its own set, not an inversion: the evening-on-the-couch\nscene is the primary one. **Strava's Record screen is the layout, matched exactly** (brief\n3, 2026-08-28): a stat card with a coloured strip floating above a separate sheet whose\npeek is the action row; Pause is one full-width pill that splits into End drive + Resume. Only\nthe palette and the components are Material. Confirmed anti-references: the pre-2026-08\ncard stack, Strava orange, hero numerals, a bottom navigation bar, iOS wheel pickers and\nCancel/Done headers.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Restrained colour: neutral ground, indigo accent, semantic state tints kept separate.",
      "Card over sheet: the stat card (strip + trio) floats above the sheet and rides its edge.",
      "Value-over-label stat cells in equal-weight trios; bold tabular figures; no hero number.",
      "Soft lift: the card, the sheet and every control floating over the map (white pills,",
      "One radius family: 12 / 16 / 28 dp and full pills.",
      "No navigation bar; chrome recedes during playback (search, 3D toggle, action row hide —"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Signal Rule",
        "body": "Indigo is the only colour allowed to mean \"act here\" or \"this is you\". If a second element on the screen also wants attention, it uses a state tint or it waits.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The State Is a Band Rule",
        "body": "Session state (ready / driving / waiting / holding / paused / error) is communicated by the strip's container colour and one line of copy — never by a new card, never by an icon alone. At cold start the card is the neutral idle band (\"Tap the map to add stops · long-press to hold\"); only the builder with no route yet (0–1 stops, \"Building a route\") hides it. The band never shows raw coordinates: while a hold's place name resolves it reads \"Holding your location\"; if the lookup fails, \"Holding at dropped pin\".",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Palette Travels Rule",
        "body": "Map colours are never literals: they come from `MapPalette` (`ui/theme/MapPalette.kt`, its light and dark instances in `ui/theme/Theme.kt`), and anything that bakes a colour into a bitmap or cache includes the palette in its key so a theme switch re-renders.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Value Over Label Rule",
        "body": "A number never appears alone: its label sits directly under it (Strava's trio), centred, and the three cells of a trio share one baseline. A trio with nothing to count is not shown — never placeholders for undefined numbers.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No Hero Rule",
        "body": "Stat trios are equal weight. No single numeral is enlarged to dominate the card.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Soft Lift Rule",
        "body": "A shadow means \"this floats over the map\". The stat card, the sheet, map pills, popovers and markers cast one — always the low value in `Tokens` (`cardElevation` / `sheetElevation` / `floatingElevation` / `popoverElevation`). Inside the sheet, hierarchy comes from container tone and the 28/16/12dp corner, never a shadow. **In dark**, a near-black shadow on the near-black basemap disappears (1.05:1, audit session 41), so floating objects use `MockarrTheme.colors.floating` — lighter than the sheet (`#292A30`, M3's tonal lift) — rimmed by a 1dp `floatingOutline` (`#6E7079`, ≥3:1 on the dark map). The sheet wears the same rim on its top edge: the dark sheet met the map at 1.07:1 (audit, session 49). Light keeps white plus shadow and no rim.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** read every colour from `MaterialTheme.colorScheme` or `MockarrTheme.colors`; map code takes a `MapPalette`.",
      "**Do** put session state in the strip's tone and copy; put transient feedback in a snackbar.",
      "**Do** present numbers as Label-over-Headline cells in equal trios with tabular figures.",
      "**Do** measure the sheet's peek at runtime and fall back to 200dp until measured.",
      "**Do** hide non-essential chrome (search, 3D, action row, thumbstick) during playback or when its state does not apply — through the `Motion` transitions, never a hard cut.",
      "**Do** hide the trio rather than show placeholders when its numbers are undefined.",
      "**Do** keep every touch target at 48dp and every list scrollable with IME padding."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add a second card above the sheet; there is one card and one sheet (popovers are transient and anchored, not cards).",
      "**Don't** enlarge one stat into a hero numeral.",
      "**Don't** use Strava orange, or any second saturated accent beside indigo.",
      "**Don't** put a shadow on anything inside the sheet; over the map, only the Soft Lift set.",
      "**Don't** add a navigation bar or tabs; everything is reachable from the sheet.",
      "**Don't** ever show raw coordinates in the strip or the notification.",
      "**Don't** add iOS chrome — wheel pickers, Cancel/Done header pairs, Cupertino switches.",
      "**Don't** hard-code a colour, radius or spacing literal in a screen; extend `Tokens` or the theme instead."
    ]
  }
